ee is composed of the maintainers of the Valkey repository and oversees all technical, project, approval, and policy matters for Valkey."},{"claim_id":"org-limit-chair","evidence_ids":["ev_89a219221165eb628dbb8392eebd7e75069d4ed07fbc7cc591ebfd50eada4c13"],"text":"No more than one third of TSC members may represent the same or affiliated organizations, and the TSC appoints a Chair responsible for organizing TSC meetings."},{"claim_id":"consensus-voting","evidence_ids":["ev_d8ace95f611b8eb8755885b728a4ae1c283769876761faef4e0ac4f4efa97a78","ev_7b8d1122ace50b8fa0da00fecfc994bca55e08cf30668663f2ddec288433bfef"],"text":"The TSC strives for consensus; if consensus cannot be reached, decisions are made by vote, with each voting member having one vote and at least two weeks to vote."},{"claim_id":"technical-major","evidence_ids":["ev_1b904cdc4966acc8871858cb7e06b6d59a9b84f831dd7bf532b2d2ff5dccc380"],"text":"Technical major decisions require a simple majority vote, or, if no majority within two weeks and no negative vote, explicit plus-two support from at least two TSC members."},{"claim_id":"governance-major","evidence_ids":["ev_7b8d1122ace50b8fa0da00fecfc994bca55e08cf30668663f2ddec288433bfef"],"text":"Governance major decisions, such as adding or removing TSC members or modifying the governance document, require a super-majority of at least two thirds of the entire TSC."},{"claim_id":"delegation","evidence_ids":["ev_a48bc57d93104ae2fa45af83bf57229bc431524fa5ccee7832e5986f3bbf2511","ev_0cf2c210f0766d4ff14ab6169342fe873d7399a5af8fd6ec4b3b80688edaf6ea"],"text":"The TSC may delegate decision making to maintainers of other Valkey organization projects and may overrule those projects' decisions, though with restraint."},{"claim_id":"membership-termination","evidence_ids":["ev_a48bc57d93104ae2fa45af83bf57229bc431524fa5ccee7832e5986f3bbf2511"],"text":"Maintainer access and TSC position end through involuntary removal by governance vote, written resignation, or a simple majority vote to remove a member unresponsive over six months."}],"executed_lambda_version":"8","expected_behavior":"answer","generation_id":"sha256:6760b22e3e09ac0e2ac64c9c23b3a77733f5bd1f8f8c9704c66d2c69d1362b60","index":3,"latency_ms":23484.557189,"message":null,"outcome":"answer","preflight_path":"cases/03-real-tsc-process/preflight.json","preflight_sha256":"sha256:a2ed4f14785adb21318b6501aff50e5a2b33c7b23a81e18ea133098dfc85536c","protocol_verdict":"pass","question":"How does the Valkey Technical Steering Committee work?","request_fence":1,"request_id":"req_deployed-eval-a5ceba7a8b887085b422f7a1dd9d856d15e447a6e28b1bd97dab07f10b02ab38","request_revision":2,"request_sha256":"sha256:9f95b1285ae7c39d0bcda6758ca2f2bc5ebf4609bebb925d57e5dc20ce9b60b2","response_sha256":"sha256:0799c7fafe86ed27ecb220a274bd1320a3eaa72288f9eac00b40dc4c8d4e18c9","result_path":"cases/03-real-tsc-process/results/03-real-tsc-process.json","result_sha256":"sha256:f3b58005f7e3015fd1b66f2cef7c3b6f9863c7e5ce26847bea994f76804378ba","route":"static","semantic_verdict":"not_evaluated","terminal_path":null,"terminal_sha256":null},{"attempt_path":"cases/04-real-upcoming-events/attempts/04-real-upcoming-events.json","attempt_sha256":"sha256:8766668786d820154bcd563fbe8e4d38eb46995204d36c8a3f7270a36f66d839","case_id":"real-upcoming-events","citations":[],"claims":[],"executed_lambda_version":"8","expected_behavior":"abstain","generation_id":null,"index":4,"latency_ms":4293.388311,"message":"Insufficient validated evidence.","outcome":"abstention","preflight_path":"cases/04-real-upcoming-events/preflight.json","preflight_sha256":"sha256:a2ed4f14785adb21318b6501aff50e5a2b33c7b23a81e18ea133098dfc85536c","protocol_verdict":"pass","question":"What upcoming Valkey events are announced right now?","request_fence":1,"request_id":"req_deployed-eval-0b8a196bc60ccc0b285e921a1c4a3a567fa0fd567ba1f8444cf8f56bbf525d9f","request_revision":2,"request_sha256":"sha256:996db9d65641cca99e9a21f561b63b14350a1a1f671bbd3c6c98a7740e2221b0",